{"n":5,"title":"The cost function","part":"B","partName":"Regression","words":888,"minutes":4,"sections":[{"id":"h-51-the-formula","title":"5.1 The formula"},{"id":"h-52-a-worked-example","title":"5.2 A worked example"},{"id":"h-53-seeing-the-bowl","title":"5.3 Seeing the bowl"},{"id":"h-54-convex-one-bottom-no-traps","title":"5.4 Convex: one bottom, no traps"},{"id":"h-55-other-ways-to-measure-error","title":"5.5 Other ways to measure error"}],"speechHash":"9fdbb728","fa":{"total":30,"translated":30},"html":"<p><strong><span data-s=\"0\" data-w=\"0\">Purpose.</span></strong> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"0\">A</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"1\">computer</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"2\">cannot</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"3\">look</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"4\">at</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"5\">a</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"6\">plot</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"7\">and</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"8\">say</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"9\">\"that</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"10\">line</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"11\">looks</span> <span data-s=\"1\" data-w=\"12\">good\".</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"0\">It</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"1\">needs</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"2\">one</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"3\">number</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"4\">that</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"5\">measures</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"6\">how</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"7\">wrong</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"8\">a</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"9\">line</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"10\">is,</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"11\">and</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"12\">the</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"13\">training</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"14\">task</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"15\">becomes</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"16\">making</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"17\">that</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"18\">number</span> <span data-s=\"2\" data-w=\"19\">small.</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><strong>هدف.</strong> کامپیوتر نمی‌تواند به یک نمودار نگاه کند و بگوید «این خط خوب به نظر می‌رسد». به یک عدد نیاز دارد که بسنجد یک خط چقدر غلط است، و وظیفه‌ی آموزش می‌شود کوچک‌کردن آن عدد.</div>\n<p><strong><span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"0\">Key</span> <span data-s=\"3\" data-w=\"1\">ideas</span></strong></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><strong>ایده‌های کلیدی</strong></div>\n<ul>\n<li><span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"1\">cost</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"2\">J(w,</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"3\">b)</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"4\">is</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"5\">the</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"6\">average</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"7\">squared</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"8\">error,</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"9\">with</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"10\">a</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"11\">factor</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"12\">1/2</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"13\">that</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"14\">tidies</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"15\">later</span> <span data-s=\"4\" data-w=\"16\">maths.</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">هزینه‌ی <code>J(w, b)</code> میانگین مربع خطا است، با ضریب 1/2 که حساب‌های بعدی را مرتب می‌کند.</div></li>\n<li><span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"0\">A</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"1\">lower</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"2\">cost</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"3\">means</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"4\">a</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"5\">better</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"6\">fit,</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"7\">so</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"8\">training</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"9\">means</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"10\">minimizing</span> <span data-s=\"5\" data-w=\"11\">J.</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">هزینه‌ی کمتر یعنی برازش بهتر، پس آموزش یعنی کمینه‌کردن <code>J</code>.</div></li>\n<li><span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"0\">J</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"1\">as</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"2\">a</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"3\">function</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"4\">of</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"5\">w</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"6\">and</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"7\">b</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"8\">is</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"9\">a</span> <span data-s=\"6\" data-w=\"10\">bowl.</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"1\">bottom</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"2\">of</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"3\">the</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"4\">bowl</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"5\">is</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"6\">the</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"7\">best</span> <span data-s=\"7\" data-w=\"8\">line.</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><code>J</code> به‌عنوان تابعی از <code>w</code> و <code>b</code> یک کاسه است. ته کاسه بهترین خط است.</div></li>\n<li><span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"0\">Squared</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"1\">error</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"2\">for</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"3\">linear</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"4\">regression</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"5\">gives</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"6\">a</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"7\">bowl</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"8\">with</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"9\">a</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"10\">single</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"11\">bottom</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"12\">(convex),</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"13\">so</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"14\">there</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"15\">are</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"16\">no</span> <span data-s=\"8\" data-w=\"17\">traps.</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">مربع خطا برای رگرسیون خطی کاسه‌ای با یک ته می‌دهد (محدب)، پس تله‌ای وجود ندارد.</div></li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"h-51-the-formula\"><span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"0\">5.1</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"1\">The</span> <span data-s=\"9\" data-w=\"2\">formula</span></h4><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">5.1 فرمول</div>\n<div class=\"math\"><span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>J</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>w</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mrow><mi>w</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">J(w,b) = \\frac{1}{2m} \\sum_{i=1}^{m} \\left( f_{w,b}(x^{(i)}) - y^{(i)} \\right)^2</annotation></semantics></math></span></div>\n<p><span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"0\">Read</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"1\">it</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"2\">from</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"3\">the</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"4\">inside</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"5\">out:</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"6\">the</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"7\">error</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"8\">of</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"9\">example</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"10\">i,</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"11\">squared,</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"12\">added</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"13\">over</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"14\">all</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"15\">m</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"16\">examples,</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"17\">divided</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"18\">by</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"19\">m</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"20\">to</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"21\">get</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"22\">an</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"23\">average</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"24\">(so</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"25\">that</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"26\">the</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"27\">number</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"28\">does</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"29\">not</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"30\">grow</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"31\">just</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"32\">because</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"33\">you</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"34\">have</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"35\">more</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"36\">data),</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"37\">and</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"38\">divided</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"39\">by</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"40\">2</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"41\">as</span> <span data-s=\"10\" data-w=\"42\">well.</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"1\">extra</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"2\">2</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"3\">does</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"4\">nothing</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"5\">to</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"6\">the</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"7\">answer:</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"8\">it</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"9\">only</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"10\">cancels</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"11\">the</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"12\">2</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"13\">that</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"14\">appears</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"15\">when</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"16\">you</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"17\">take</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"18\">the</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"19\">derivative</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"20\">in</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"21\">Chapter</span> <span data-s=\"11\" data-w=\"22\">6.</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">آن را از داخل به بیرون بخوان: خطای نمونه‌ی <code>i</code>، به توان دو، جمع‌شده روی همه‌ی <code>m</code> نمونه، تقسیم بر <code>m</code> تا میانگین به دست بیاید (تا عدد فقط به‌خاطر داده‌ی بیشتر بزرگ نشود)، و باز تقسیم بر 2. این 2 اضافی هیچ تغییری در جواب نمی‌دهد: فقط 2ای را خنثی می‌کند که هنگام مشتق‌گرفتن در فصل 6 پیدا می‌شود.</div>\n<h4 id=\"h-52-a-worked-example\"><span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"0\">5.2</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"1\">A</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"2\">worked</span> <span data-s=\"12\" data-w=\"3\">example</span></h4><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">5.2 یک مثال حل‌شده</div>\n<p><span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"0\">Use</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"1\">the</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"2\">three</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"3\">points</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"4\">(1,</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"5\">1),</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"6\">(2,</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"7\">2),</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"8\">(3,</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"9\">3)</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"10\">and</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"11\">fix</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"12\">b</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"13\">=</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"14\">0,</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"15\">so</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"16\">the</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"17\">cost</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"18\">depends</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"19\">only</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"20\">on</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"21\">w.</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"22\">For</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"23\">w</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"24\">=</span> <span data-s=\"13\" data-w=\"25\">0.5:</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">سه نقطه‌ی <code>(1, 1)</code> و <code>(2, 2)</code> و <code>(3, 3)</code> را بگیر و <code>b = 0</code> را ثابت کن، پس هزینه فقط به <code>w</code> بستگی دارد. برای <code>w = 0.5</code>:</div>\n<p><span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"0\">J</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"1\">=</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"2\">1</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"3\">/</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"4\">(2</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"5\">x</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"6\">3)</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"7\">x</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"8\">(</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"9\">(0.5</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"10\">-</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"11\">1)^2</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"12\">+</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"13\">(1</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"14\">-</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"15\">2)^2</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"16\">+</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"17\">(1.5</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"18\">-</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"19\">3)^2</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"20\">)</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"21\">=</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"22\">(0.25</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"23\">+</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"24\">1</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"25\">+</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"26\">2.25)</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"27\">/</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"28\">6</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"29\">=</span> <span data-s=\"14\" data-w=\"30\">0.583</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><code>J = 1 / (2 x 3) x ( (0.5 - 1)^2 + (1 - 2)^2 + (1.5 - 3)^2 ) = (0.25 + 1 + 2.25) / 6 = 0.583</code></div>\n<div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr>\n<th>w</th>\n<th>The line</th>\n<th>Cost J(w)</th>\n</tr>\n</thead><tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>Goes through every point</td>\n<td>0</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0.5</td>\n<td>Too flat</td>\n<td>0.583</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>Flat at zero</td>\n<td>2.333</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<p><span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"0\">Plot</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"1\">cost</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"2\">against</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"3\">w</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"4\">and</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"5\">you</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"6\">get</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"7\">a</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"8\">parabola</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"9\">(a</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"10\">U</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"11\">shape)</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"12\">whose</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"13\">lowest</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"14\">point</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"15\">is</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"16\">at</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"17\">w</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"18\">=</span> <span data-s=\"15\" data-w=\"19\">1.</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"1\">goal</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"2\">of</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"3\">linear</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"4\">regression</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"5\">is</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"6\">to</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"7\">find</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"8\">the</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"9\">w</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"10\">and</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"11\">b</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"12\">that</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"13\">sit</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"14\">at</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"15\">the</span> <span data-s=\"16\" data-w=\"16\">bottom.</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">هزینه را در برابر <code>w</code> رسم کن، یک سهمی (شکل U) می‌گیری که پایین‌ترین نقطه‌اش در <code>w = 1</code> است. هدف رگرسیون خطی پیدا کردن <code>w</code> و <code>b</code>ای است که در ته می‌نشینند.</div>\n<pre><code class=\"language-python\">import numpy as np\n\nx = np.array([1.0, 2.0, 3.0])\ny = np.array([1.0, 2.0, 3.0])\n\ndef cost(w, b):\n    return np.sum((w * x + b - y) ** 2) / (2 * len(x))\n\nprint(cost(1, 0), round(cost(0.5, 0), 3), round(cost(0, 0), 3))   # 0.0 0.583 2.333\n</code></pre>\n<h4 id=\"h-53-seeing-the-bowl\"><span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"0\">5.3</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"1\">Seeing</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"2\">the</span> <span data-s=\"17\" data-w=\"3\">bowl</span></h4><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">5.3 دیدن کاسه</div>\n<p><span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"0\">With</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"1\">both</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"2\">w</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"3\">and</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"4\">b</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"5\">free,</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"6\">J</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"7\">is</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"8\">a</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"9\">surface</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"10\">over</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"11\">a</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"12\">plane:</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"13\">a</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"14\">bowl,</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"15\">like</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"16\">a</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"17\">soup</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"18\">bowl</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"19\">or</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"20\">a</span> <span data-s=\"18\" data-w=\"21\">hammock.</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"0\">A</span> <strong><span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"1\">contour</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"2\">plot</span></strong> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"3\">shows</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"4\">the</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"5\">same</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"6\">bowl</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"7\">from</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"8\">above,</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"9\">like</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"10\">a</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"11\">topographic</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"12\">map:</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"13\">every</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"14\">ring</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"15\">is</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"16\">a</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"17\">set</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"18\">of</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"19\">(w,</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"20\">b)</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"21\">pairs</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"22\">with</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"23\">the</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"24\">same</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"25\">cost,</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"26\">and</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"27\">the</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"28\">centre</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"29\">is</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"30\">the</span> <span data-s=\"19\" data-w=\"31\">minimum.</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"0\">In</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"1\">Ng's</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"2\">housing</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"3\">example</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"4\">a</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"5\">point</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"6\">far</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"7\">from</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"8\">the</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"9\">centre</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"10\">(w</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"11\">about</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"12\">-0.15,</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"13\">b</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"14\">about</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"15\">800)</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"16\">is</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"17\">a</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"18\">very</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"19\">bad</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"20\">line,</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"21\">while</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"22\">points</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"23\">near</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"24\">the</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"25\">centre</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"26\">fit</span> <span data-s=\"20\" data-w=\"27\">well.</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"0\">Reading</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"1\">such</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"2\">plots</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"3\">by</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"4\">hand</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"5\">does</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"6\">not</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"7\">scale,</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"8\">so</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"9\">we</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"10\">need</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"11\">an</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"12\">algorithm</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"13\">that</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"14\">walks</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"15\">to</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"16\">the</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"17\">centre</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"18\">by</span> <span data-s=\"21\" data-w=\"19\">itself.</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"0\">That</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"1\">is</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"2\">gradient</span> <span data-s=\"22\" data-w=\"3\">descent.</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">وقتی هر دو <code>w</code> و <code>b</code> آزادند، <code>J</code> یک سطح روی یک صفحه است: یک کاسه، مثل کاسه‌ی سوپ یا یک بانوج. <strong>نمودار تراز (contour plot)</strong> همان کاسه را از بالا نشان می‌دهد، مثل نقشه‌ی توپوگرافی: هر حلقه مجموعه‌ای از زوج‌های <code>(w, b)</code> با هزینه‌ی یکسان است و مرکز مینیمم است. در مثال خانه‌های Ng نقطه‌ای دور از مرکز (<code>w</code> حدود 0.15- و <code>b</code> حدود 800) یک خط خیلی بد است، در حالی که نقطه‌های نزدیک مرکز خوب برازش می‌شوند. خواندن دستی چنین نمودارهایی مقیاس‌پذیر نیست، پس به الگوریتمی نیاز داریم که خودش تا مرکز راه برود. آن <strong>گرادیان کاهشی</strong> است.</div>\n<h4 id=\"h-54-convex-one-bottom-no-traps\"><span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"0\">5.4</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"1\">Convex:</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"2\">one</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"3\">bottom,</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"4\">no</span> <span data-s=\"23\" data-w=\"5\">traps</span></h4><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">5.4 محدب: یک ته، بدون تله</div>\n<p><span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"1\">squared-error</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"2\">cost</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"3\">of</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"4\">linear</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"5\">regression</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"6\">is</span> <strong><span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"7\">convex</span></strong><span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"7\">:</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"8\">one</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"9\">bowl,</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"10\">one</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"11\">lowest</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"12\">point,</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"13\">no</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"14\">side</span> <span data-s=\"24\" data-w=\"15\">valleys.</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"0\">Wherever</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"1\">you</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"2\">start,</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"3\">going</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"4\">downhill</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"5\">ends</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"6\">at</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"7\">the</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"8\">global</span> <span data-s=\"25\" data-w=\"9\">minimum.</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"1\">cost</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"2\">surface</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"3\">of</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"4\">a</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"5\">neural</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"6\">network</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"7\">is</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"8\">not</span> <span data-s=\"26\" data-w=\"9\">convex.</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"0\">It</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"1\">has</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"2\">many</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"3\">valleys</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"4\">(local</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"5\">minima),</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"6\">and</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"7\">where</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"8\">training</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"9\">ends</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"10\">depends</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"11\">on</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"12\">where</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"13\">it</span> <span data-s=\"27\" data-w=\"14\">started.</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">هزینه‌ی مربع خطای رگرسیون خطی <strong>محدب (convex)</strong> است: یک کاسه، یک پایین‌ترین نقطه، بدون دره‌ی کناری. از هر جا شروع کنی، رفتن به سمت پایین به مینیمم سراسری می‌رسد. سطح هزینه‌ی یک شبکه‌ی عصبی محدب نیست. دره‌های زیادی (مینیمم‌های محلی) دارد و جایی که آموزش تمام می‌شود به این بستگی دارد که از کجا شروع شده.</div>\n<h4 id=\"h-55-other-ways-to-measure-error\"><span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"0\">5.5</span> <span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"1\">Other</span> <span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"2\">ways</span> <span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"3\">to</span> <span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"4\">measure</span> <span data-s=\"28\" data-w=\"5\">error</span></h4><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">5.5 روش‌های دیگر برای اندازه‌گیری خطا</div>\n<p><em><span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"0\">Beyond</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"1\">the</span> <span data-s=\"29\" data-w=\"2\">videos.</span></em> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"1\">squared</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"2\">error</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"3\">is</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"4\">the</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"5\">standard</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"6\">choice,</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"7\">but</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"8\">there</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"9\">are</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"10\">others,</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"11\">and</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"12\">you</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"13\">will</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"14\">meet</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"15\">these</span> <span data-s=\"30\" data-w=\"16\">names:</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><strong>بیرون از ویدیوها.</strong> مربع خطا انتخاب استاندارد است، ولی بقیه هم هستند و با این نام‌ها روبه‌رو می‌شوی:</div>\n<div class=\"tbl\"><table><thead><tr>\n<th>Measure</th>\n<th>Formula in words</th>\n<th>Notes</th>\n</tr>\n</thead><tbody><tr>\n<td>MSE (mean squared error)</td>\n<td>average of the squared errors</td>\n<td>the cost J without the 1/2: here 2 x 0.583 = 1.167</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RMSE</td>\n<td>square root of the MSE</td>\n<td>same units as y, so easier to explain: 1.08 here</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MAE (mean absolute error)</td>\n<td>average of the absolute errors</td>\n<td>treats all errors alike, less hurt by outliers</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>R squared</td>\n<td>1 minus (error around the fit) / (error around the mean)</td>\n<td>1 is perfect, 0 is no better than always guessing the average</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<p><span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"0\">A</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"1\">bank</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"2\">manager</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"3\">understands</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"4\">\"typically</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"5\">wrong</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"6\">by</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"7\">22</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"8\">euros</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"9\">a</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"10\">month\"</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"11\">(RMSE)</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"12\">better</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"13\">than</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"14\">\"mean</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"15\">squared</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"16\">error</span> <span data-s=\"31\" data-w=\"17\">480\".</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">یک مدیر بانک «معمولاً 22 یورو در ماه اشتباه» (RMSE) را بهتر از «میانگین مربع خطا 480» می‌فهمد.</div>\n<p><strong><span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"0\">Loan</span> <span data-s=\"32\" data-w=\"1\">example.</span></strong> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"0\">Take</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"1\">the</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"2\">monthly</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"3\">cost</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"4\">of</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"5\">each</span> <span data-s=\"33\" data-w=\"6\">offer.</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"0\">The</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"1\">cost</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"2\">J</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"3\">measures</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"4\">how</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"5\">far,</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"6\">on</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"7\">average</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"8\">and</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"9\">squared,</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"10\">the</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"11\">predicted</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"12\">monthly</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"13\">cost</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"14\">is</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"15\">from</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"16\">the</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"17\">real</span> <span data-s=\"34\" data-w=\"18\">one.</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"0\">One</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"1\">outlier</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"2\">offer</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"3\">with</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"4\">a</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"5\">500</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"6\">euro</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"7\">error</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"8\">adds</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"9\">as</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"10\">much</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"11\">squared</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"12\">error</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"13\">as</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"14\">25</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"15\">offers</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"16\">with</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"17\">a</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"18\">100</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"19\">euro</span> <span data-s=\"35\" data-w=\"20\">error.</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"0\">Check</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"1\">whether</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"2\">that</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"3\">is</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"4\">what</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"5\">you</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"6\">want,</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"7\">because</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"8\">it</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"9\">decides</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"10\">whether</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"11\">MSE</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"12\">or</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"13\">MAE</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"14\">suits</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"15\">the</span> <span data-s=\"36\" data-w=\"16\">business.</span></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><strong>مثال وام.</strong> هزینه‌ی ماهانه‌ی هر پیشنهاد را بگیر. هزینه‌ی <code>J</code> اندازه می‌گیرد هزینه‌ی ماهانه‌ی پیش‌بینی‌شده به‌طور میانگین و به توان دو چقدر از هزینه‌ی واقعی فاصله دارد. یک پیشنهاد پرت با خطای 500 یورو به‌اندازه‌ی 25 پیشنهاد با خطای 100 یورو مربع خطا اضافه می‌کند. بررسی کن این همان چیزی است که می‌خواهی، چون تعیین می‌کند MSE به کسب‌وکار می‌خورد یا MAE.</div>\n<p><strong><span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"0\">Common</span> <span data-s=\"37\" data-w=\"1\">mistakes</span></strong></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><strong>اشتباه‌های رایج</strong></div>\n<ul>\n<li><span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"0\">Comparing</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"1\">the</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"2\">cost</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"3\">of</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"4\">two</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"5\">models</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"6\">on</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"7\">different</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"8\">datasets,</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"9\">or</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"10\">one</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"11\">on</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"12\">training</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"13\">and</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"14\">one</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"15\">on</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"16\">test</span> <span data-s=\"38\" data-w=\"17\">data.</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">مقایسه‌ی هزینه‌ی دو مدل روی مجموعه‌داده‌های متفاوت، یا یکی روی داده‌ی آموزش و دیگری روی تست.</div></li>\n<li><span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"0\">Forgetting</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"1\">that</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"2\">the</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"3\">cost</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"4\">depends</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"5\">on</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"6\">the</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"7\">units</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"8\">of</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"9\">y.</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"10\">A</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"11\">cost</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"12\">of</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"13\">480</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"14\">is</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"15\">large</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"16\">for</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"17\">prices</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"18\">in</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"19\">dollars</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"20\">and</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"21\">tiny</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"22\">for</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"23\">prices</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"24\">in</span> <span data-s=\"39\" data-w=\"25\">cents.</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">فراموش کردن اینکه هزینه به واحد <code>y</code> بستگی دارد. هزینه‌ی 480 برای قیمت به دلار بزرگ است و برای قیمت به سنت ناچیز.</div></li>\n<li><span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"0\">Believing</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"1\">a</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"2\">low</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"3\">cost</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"4\">proves</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"5\">the</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"6\">model</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"7\">is</span> <span data-s=\"40\" data-w=\"8\">good.</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"0\">It</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"1\">might</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"2\">simply</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"3\">fit</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"4\">the</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"5\">training</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"6\">data</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"7\">too</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"8\">closely</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"9\">(Chapter</span> <span data-s=\"41\" data-w=\"10\">11).</span><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">باور اینکه هزینه‌ی کم ثابت می‌کند مدل خوب است. شاید فقط داده‌ی آموزشی را بیش‌ازحد دقیق برازش کرده (فصل 11).</div></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Check yourself</strong></p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><strong>خودت را بسنج</strong></div>\n<ul>\n<li>Compute J for the points (1, 2), (2, 4) and w = 2, b = 0.<div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">برای نقطه‌های <code>(1, 2)</code> و <code>(2, 4)</code> و <code>w = 2</code> و <code>b = 0</code> مقدار <code>J</code> را حساب کن.</div></li>\n<li>Why divide by m? Why divide by 2?<div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">چرا تقسیم بر <code>m</code>؟ چرا تقسیم بر 2؟</div></li>\n<li>What does convex mean, and why is it good news?<div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">محدب (convex) یعنی چه و چرا خبر خوبی است؟</div></li>\n</ul>\n<details class=\"answers\"><summary>Show answers</summary><p> (1) The line predicts 2 and 4, the errors are 0, so J = 0. (2) Dividing by m makes the cost an average that does not depend on the amount of data; the 2 only cancels the 2 from the derivative. (3) The cost has one bottom and no false valleys, so downhill always ends at the best solution.</p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\">(1) خط 2 و 4 را پیش‌بینی می‌کند، خطاها صفرند، پس <code>J = 0</code>. (2) تقسیم بر <code>m</code> هزینه را به میانگین تبدیل می‌کند تا به مقدار داده وابسته نباشد؛ عدد 2 فقط 2 حاصل از مشتق را خنثی می‌کند. (3) هزینه یک ته دارد و دره‌ی کاذب ندارد، پس رفتن به سمت پایین همیشه به بهترین جواب می‌رسد.</div></details>\n<p><strong>Go deeper:</strong> Ng, course 1, videos 11 to 14 · Google's <a href=\"https://developers.google.com/machine-learning/crash-course\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Linear regression</a> module in the crash course · the scikit-learn page on <a href=\"https://scikit-learn.org/stable/modules/model_evaluation.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">model evaluation</a> for the other error measures.</p><div class=\"fa\" lang=\"fa\" dir=\"rtl\"><strong>برای مطالعه‌ی بیشتر:</strong> Ng، درس 1، ویدیوهای 11 تا 14 · ماژول Linear regression در Crash Course گوگل · صفحه‌ی ارزیابی مدل scikit-learn برای معیارهای دیگر خطا.</div>\n"}